  "goodToKnow": "Der Ehebruch is adultery, a formal or biblical word (Du sollst nicht ehebrechen). In West Germany it was a criminal offence until 1969, and since the 1977 divorce reform it no longer matters legally who is at fault; the Zerrüttungsprinzip (breakdown of marriage) applies. Everyday speech says fremdgehen or einen Seitensprung machen. Plural: die Ehebrüche."
